<title>BELGIUM: Belgium liquidity little changed at money tender.</title>
<headline>Belgium liquidity little changed at money tender.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian National Bank left little changed liquidity at its fixed-rate tender for seven-day advances. The auction was brought forward from Monday because of the Armistice Day holiday. Details -</p>
<p>    Value date 13/11	  expiry on 20/11</p>
<p>    Amount allotted	   13.575 bln bfr    (13.600 bln *)</p>
<p>    Interest rate	     3.00 pct	    (3.00 pct **)</p>
<p>    Total amount of bids    13.575 bln bfr</p>
<p>Percentage of bids accepted  100</p>
<p>* amount draining from the money market on 13/11</p>
<p>** interest rate at previous tender on 04/11</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
